  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chronic Crisis Stream 2023-27-DRC-ECC MERU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to support communities affected by ongoing crisis by providing the following services:
- 25 Groups will be supported by cash through the Survivors and communities led responses (SCLR) approach to support micro project to meets their needs.
- Communities affected by crisis will get access to clean water through the construction of water points.
- Communities affected by crisis will be supported to conduct PVCA sessions and CAPs raised will be supported into strength the resilience of communities to cope with risk and chocs.
- Locals&#x2019; leaders and communities will be trained and sensitized on climate change effects.
- Communities will be supported to access seeds resistant to climate change effect.
- Communities&#x2019; members will be trained and supported to set up preventive measures against climate change effects (soil control, reforestation...).</narrative>
  </description>
